# Helsinki UDBMS Patent: the sources ExportSources lifts to the meta level.
#
# Five relational tables and one citation edge type, which is the split the publisher ships.
# There is no document line because this dataset has no document half.

postgres     pg     hpatent  patent
postgres     pg     hpatent  inventor
postgres     pg     hpatent  assignee
postgres     pg     hpatent  class
postgres     pg     hpatent  category

# The nodes carry only an identifier: the citation edge list is what the graph half contributes,
# and every patent attribute lives in the relational half. Nodes exist for identifiers the
# relational table does not have, which is where the cited endpoint's partial degree comes from.
neo4j-label  graph  neo4j    HPatent

# One relationship type, CITES. Its two endpoints reference the same relational key and hold to
# very different degrees; that asymmetry is the reason this instance is here.
neo4j-rels   graph  neo4j    CITES
